{"4964260":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cabin in Time","steam_appid":4964260,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5257560],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sense of Scale<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count all the atoms in the universe, a trillion million times, do that for 100 times, then you get a single atom for the cabin<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras\/5ca09d4c12f50f954fc00f69137f1b0c.avif?t=1793656554\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras_big\/5ca09d4c12f50f954fc00f69137f1b0c.avif?t=1793656554 width=1560 height=984 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Incremental Fantasy<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an incremental game centered around a googol-gear machine with a 10:1 ratio, where your goal is to finish building a mountain cabin. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll first have to manually crank the initial gear. Then, you'll progressively unlock new and better drivers for it, all while maintaining the 10:1 ratio for every subsequent gear (10 revolutions of gear <i>n<\/i> equal 1 revolution of gear <i>n+1<\/i>, where <i>n<\/i> is between 1 and 99).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also need power generators to run those drivers. You will keep upgrading these until you reach the physical limits of the universe, at which point you'll have to build a brand-new universe that accounts for an upgraded googol machine.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endgoal<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinse and repeat until the final gear starts spinning. And it needs to spin a lot—a googol spins just to generate a single atom for your dream cabin in the mountains. It takes time, lots and lots of it, but in the end, you'll have completed the longest-running construction project in history (any history, anywhere in space and time)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras\/4c7290b6fcd121f0da10caef8507c1c3.avif?t=1793656554\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras_big\/4c7290b6fcd121f0da10caef8507c1c3.avif?t=1793656554 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sense of Scale<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Count all the atoms in the universe, a trillion million times, do that for 100 times, then you get a single atom for the cabin<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras\/5ca09d4c12f50f954fc00f69137f1b0c.avif?t=1793656554\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras_big\/5ca09d4c12f50f954fc00f69137f1b0c.avif?t=1793656554 width=1560 height=984 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Incremental Fantasy<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an incremental game centered around a googol-gear machine with a 10:1 ratio, where your goal is to finish building a mountain cabin. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll first have to manually crank the initial gear. Then, you'll progressively unlock new and better drivers for it, all while maintaining the 10:1 ratio for every subsequent gear (10 revolutions of gear <i>n<\/i> equal 1 revolution of gear <i>n+1<\/i>, where <i>n<\/i> is between 1 and 99).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also need power generators to run those drivers. You will keep upgrading these until you reach the physical limits of the universe, at which point you'll have to build a brand-new universe that accounts for an upgraded googol machine.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Endgoal<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinse and repeat until the final gear starts spinning. And it needs to spin a lot—a googol spins just to generate a single atom for your dream cabin in the mountains. It takes time, lots and lots of it, but in the end, you'll have completed the longest-running construction project in history (any history, anywhere in space and time)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras\/4c7290b6fcd121f0da10caef8507c1c3.avif?t=1793656554\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/extras_big\/4c7290b6fcd121f0da10caef8507c1c3.avif?t=1793656554 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Incremental game where you get to continually break an increasing speed of light across many universes in order to make the 100th gear of a googol machine spin","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/d06ef8edf37a1e3a1d03fad5631f49e14dbe520e\/header.jpg?t=1793656554","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/b7aa37a18a3da892e23947790e16455861a5071b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793656554","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/b7aa37a18a3da892e23947790e16455861a5071b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793656554","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10, 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU, Intel HD Graphics 4000 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any standard audio device<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10, 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD Ryzen 3 equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU or modern integrated GPU with OpenGL 3.3 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any standard audio device<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["dreamer"],"publishers":["dreamer"],"demos":[{"appid":5257560,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":289,"final":193,"discount_percent":33,"initial_formatted":"2,89€","final_formatted":"1,93€"},"packages":[1722642],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Cabin in Time","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1722642,"percent_savings_text":"-33% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Cabin in Time - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">2,89€<\/span> 1,93€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":193}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4964260\/0055851c987f3b36fc14ebb7087d3415dcd3bdd5\/ss_0055851c987f3b36fc14ebb7087d3415dcd3bdd5.600x338.jpg?t=1793656554","pa